---
source: crates/acpilot-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: stdout(&ext)
---
Install, verify, and approve extensions

Usage: acpilot ext <COMMAND>

Commands:
  add           Install an extension from a local directory
  import-theme  Import a TextMate `.tmTheme` as a theme extension and install it
  verify        Rehash every installed version and report any that are blocked
  prune         Remove versions no profile activates
  activate      Approve an installed extension for one profile
  deactivate    Withdraw approval from one profile
  why           Explain how a preset or agent resolves for one profile
  help          Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
